-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1000, case P08: every read of the section GIVEN `r` is
-- overridden, so the row's `r` is never read. `l4 run` answers 300.

§ `Rates`
    GIVEN r IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
inner MEANS r

@export Every read overridden
GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
outer b MEANS b PLUS (inner WITH r IS 100) PLUS (inner WITH r IS 100) PLUS (inner WITH r IS 100)

#EVAL outer 0
